6. Retry Example
return webClient
        .get()
        .uri("/customer")

        .retrieve()
        .bodyToMono(Customer.class)

        .retry(3);


Execution

Attempt 1 -> Fail

Attempt 2 -> Fail

Attempt 3 -> Success


Better

.retryWhen(
    Retry.fixedDelay(
        3,
        Duration.ofSeconds(1)
    )
)


Interview One-Liner

Retry is useful for temporary network failures.

